Screen: Login

  Element: Login Form
    Show: Email address
    And: Password
    And: Login button

  Element: Login Button
    Disable
    Hide: Error message

    When: Input is valid
    Enable

    When: Input is invalid
    Disable
    Show: Error message

  Element: User Information
    Show: Username
    Hide: Full name
    And: Greeting

    When: Viewing your own profile
    Show: Username
    And: Full name
    And: Greeting
